Cell["\<\
The key $auto has been populated with an association which in the present \
example contains only one key-value pair: XX -> <assoc>. This might feel \
somewhat redundant. SolutionsX has been designed like that since for more \
complicated objects, say the metric, aside from the specified tensor multiple \
other tensors are defined:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1727,ExpressionUUID->"b75af1f5-1f8c-4fcb-a213-e2bf6240d7a2"],

