Cell["\<\
The noteworthy piece in the above code is how the array that fills up CC[-\
\[GothicCapitalI],-\[GothicCapitalJ],-\[GothicCapitalK]] is created. xAct \
defines the totally antisymmetric tensor density etaDowninternal, and we can \
see how its array looks with ToArray. We can then use Abs to take the \
absolute value of each component:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1768,ExpressionUUID->"40a6c6da-3d88-4cc1-b2d5-09aaee67d758"],

