     RowBox[{"Symmetry", " ", "->", " ", "None"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"SpinorType", " ", "->", " ", "Dirac"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[131]:=",
 CellID->1901,ExpressionUUID->"df816d62-8e1b-4903-bfad-c0ad1d4ccc08"],

Cell["\<\
It is good practice to derive the Killing spinor equations directly from the \
Lagrangian. To actually do that we need to supply the fermions as well. We \
defer the reader to the FieldsX documentation on how one can do that. Here we \
simply type in the correct spinor equations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1902,ExpressionUUID->"f1357b7b-7aa5-437c-9d30-c017cb2d8ffe"],

